<title>USA: New York physical copper market - Mar 10.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - Mar 10.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for March shipment were quoted at a nominal 117.40 to 117.65 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 91.00 cents, down 2 cents from March 7th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
